~ start
???: [[Hi|Hello|Howdy]], stranger.
???: Welcome aboard!.
???: My name's [wave]Skelly[/wave], short for Skeleton. 
Skelly: Are ye the new delivery guy?
- Yes
	Skelly: Good, now deliver this package for me!
- No
	Skelly: Buddy, you don't have a [wave]choice[/wave], deliver this for me!!
- Maybe
	Skelly: Hah, well deliver this package for me!

do spawn_package()
do moneyManager.delivering = true
=> END

~ delivering
Skelly: What are you doing, brother? Deliver these packages to the destination.
- How exactly can I do that?
	Skelly: To pick up a package click `E` on your keyboard.
	Skelly: As for the delivery destination, look at your surroundings. That blinking package icon is where you should go.
	Skelly: Take care of yourself now. [wave]Bye![/wave]
- Alright, I will go now.
	Skelly: Take care of yourself now.
=> END

~ one_delivered
Skelly: Nice, you delivered one package. Now are you ready for some more?
Skelly: Deliver 4 more and I will give you a bonus.
- Sure, bro
	Skelly: Alright, deliver these for me.
	do spawn_package()
	do spawn_package()
	do spawn_package()
	do spawn_package()
- Maybe later
	Skelly: Okay, come back here if you decided to continue with the deliveries.
	
=> END	